# A step that writes one file itself and through a step it calls: two channels to one place, never merged
# (sentence 6, rule 3). Closed, `export` draws a solid line and a dashed one to `out.csv`, each counting one.

route exporter.main
step main/export
step main/export/write_header

line entry > main call
line main/export/write_header > File(out.csv) own
line main/export > File(out.csv) own                     # export appends to the file itself

side entry left
side File(out.csv) right
